    "detailed_description": "The Japanese-style \u201cNinja Room\u201d has some mysteries.<br>You must solve these mysteries and escape from Ninja Room.<br><br>how to play:<br>\u30fbClick on the place of interest to find out.<br>\u30fbSelect an item and click where you want to use it.<br>\u30fbSelect an item and click the magnifying glass to see details of the item.<br>\u30fbYou can move the viewpoint by dragging while holding down the left mouse button.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202510/extras/e52efd4f40215d232b0d76abe0f6a6a5.poster.avif?t=1576819394\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202510/extras/e52efd4f40215d232b0d76abe0f6a6a5.webm?t=1576819394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202510/extras/e52efd4f40215d232b0d76abe0f6a6a5.mp4?t=1576819394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Feature\uff1a<br>\u25a0 Simple operability<br>\u25a0 Japanese style room<br>\u25a0 multiple of mystery and tricks<br>\u25a0 Relax and play<br>\u25a0 You can also play \u201c10 clock\u201d<br><br>As an added bonus to this game, you can also play the escape game \u201c10 clock\u201d.<br>In this game, find 10 hidden clocks and escape from the room.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202510/extras/d9569364753b8d09f33e25fb386506c6.avif?t=1576819394\" /></div>",
